# ── macOS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# ── Node / Bun ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/

# ── Python ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# ── Advisor framework — runtime & personal session data ───────────────────
# All session plumbing (workspaces, channel JSONL, bootstrap prompts, launch.sh)
.advisor-runs/

# Deliverables output written into a repo when advisor is invoked from it
# (lib/summon.js → computeOutputDir() → ensureGitignore() auto-adds this
#  to target repos; include here so this template repo is also covered)
.advisor-output/

# ── Vault data — never commit ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Each user builds their own vault as they use the advisor; only the code that
# manages a vault belongs in this repo. The default root is ~/.advisor/vault,
# outside any checkout — but vaultRoot() is `process.env.ADVISOR_VAULT ||
# ~/.advisor/vault`, so ADVISOR_VAULT can point *inside* a working copy (an
# easy thing to do while testing). These patterns make committing note content
# or the SQLite index impossible rather than merely unlikely.
#
# Deliberately scoped under a `vault/` parent: bare `lessons/` or `sessions/`
# would also swallow unrelated future repo directories with those names.
.advisor/
**/vault/.cache/
**/vault/lessons/
**/vault/synthesis/
**/vault/sessions/
**/vault/projects/
**/vault/reminders/
vault.db
vault.db-wal
vault.db-shm

# ── Claude Code runtime artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/settings.local.json

# ── Personal / scratch files ──────────────────────────────────────────────
agent-teams-conversation.md
ideaar.md

# ── Ephemeral test output ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
test/*.txt

# ── Local docs scratch area ────────────────────────────────────────────────
/docs

# ── graphify generated code-knowledge graph (regenerated via graphify update) ─
graphify-out/
